docs {
  # Delete Blood Inventory
  
  Deletes a blood inventory record. Requires authentication.
  
  ## Authentication
  Requires JWT token in Authorization header
  
  ## Path Parameters
  - `id` (string, required): Inventory ID
  
  ## Response
  Success message and deleted inventory object
  
  ## Status Codes
  - 200: Success
  - 400: Invalid inventory ID
  - 401: Missing or invalid token
  - 404: Inventory not found
  - 500: Server error
}
